  inward:keeper = (self + committee) : keeper — the metric as muscle_map defines it.
  self:keeper is reported beside it because tell-index computes that one over the board;
  two gauges using one word differently is how a room argues about a number.
  "withheld" means unattributed events outnumbered attributed ones in that window. No
  ratio is printed there, on purpose: a number nobody can defend is worse than none.

